      "description": "The charger or charge controller regulates to the wrong voltage (wrong profile, failed temperature compensation, faulty sensing lead) or does not stop charging. Cells exceed the maximum charge voltage; Li-ion risks lithium plating and thermal runaway, lead-acid gasses (hydrogen) and dries out.",
